WEBVTT

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:51.060
It is all right.

00:01:51.760 --> 00:01:54.220
Akamashi has not come yet.

00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.790
This country's princess certainly seems strong.

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:16.130
Now, it's your turn.

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:46.090
Who's there?

00:02:56.740 --> 00:02:59.060
Oh, it's you, Pops.

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:01.350
Superb.

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:05.380
Could this be the effort that you don't want to show other people?

00:03:05.850 --> 00:03:07.700
No, not really.

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:12.380
I was just thinking that I should try to become more familiar with this body.

00:03:23.630 --> 00:03:25.610
It must be very uncomfortable for you,

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:27.500
living the princess' life.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:35.310
Anyway, while we are reorganizing the country, please protect Forland for a while.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.030
Mistress Faris.

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:42.420
Right... Because I promised Mirano.

00:03:45.680 --> 00:03:47.390
Hurry up with the reorganization.

00:03:55.850 --> 00:03:58.190
If Prince Kaito returns...

00:04:00.830 --> 00:04:03.560
Good morning, Princess!

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:09.260
Princess.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:13.290
Please wake up, Princess.

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.330
Geeze!

00:04:31.780 --> 00:04:33.620
Ow, ow, ow...

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.090
What are you doing, Mirano?

00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.030
Nothing, just...

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:42.330
Damnit, isn't this your face?

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:45.530
Is it fun staring at it up close?

00:04:45.940 --> 00:04:50.050
Seeing your own face on a different person is a new experience, isn't it?

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:57.180
Anyway, you have to hurry up and find a man. A m-a-n.

00:04:57.450 --> 00:05:00.050
Umm... That's really...

00:05:00.910 --> 00:05:05.820
Ever since I was a child, the only men I've been close to were my father and Jodo...

00:05:06.560 --> 00:05:08.830
And also my brother, I guess.

00:05:10.340 --> 00:05:11.160
Brother?

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:15.670
Mirano's brother, Prince Kaito.

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:18.870
That is to say, the rightful heir to Forland's throne,

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:21.830
left on an expedition to the neighboring country of Grandel.

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.640
It was for a peace negotiation,

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:28.440
but we've heard nothing from him since then.

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.860
What kind of a person is Prince Kaito?

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:39.370
He is the leader of Forland's specialized knight unit because he is a skilled swordsman.

00:05:40.040 --> 00:05:43.220
Even though he's eight years older than me,

00:05:44.060 --> 00:05:47.400
he's always been good to me. He's a very kind brother.

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:53.770
He thinks of the nation's people, and is very loyal and courteous.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:55.730
He's a very strong person.

00:06:00.780 --> 00:06:04.610
Wouldn't it be great if he came back soon?

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:09.920
Yes, I suppose so.

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:15.510
If my brother comes back, the throne will pass to him. If so...

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:20.050
What will happen if that occurs?

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:24.890
If brother becomes King, Faris would leave...

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:33.920
Here.

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:44.870
The tea you make is truly exceptional.

00:06:45.450 --> 00:06:46.660
Thank you very much.

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:54.840
Well then...

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:06.760
What is it?

00:07:07.450 --> 00:07:10.540
That was awful- breaking this doll!

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:12.650
That was an accident! It couldn't be helped!

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:15.110
Don't say it couldn't be helped!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:17.850
This doll is...

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:21.070
That's...

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:26.640
You don't understand my feelings at all, Princess.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.010
You're right, I don't understand!

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:37.670
Hey, Mistress!

00:08:02.470 --> 00:08:05.030
What are you achieving by frightening our allies?

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:07.620
Excuse me, your majesty...

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:09.310
What is it?

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:15.310
We have received a report from the people that goblins have settled in the Shianna Valley.

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:18.810
We would usually send the army to get rid of them,

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:20.920
but at the moment, our country is...

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:24.340
The leader of the knights is away in another country.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:27.810
And the national army was totally destroyed in the coup d'état a few days ago?

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.050
Perfect opportunity.

00:08:34.100 --> 00:08:35.450
I'll take care of it.

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.360
What's Pete up to?

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:44.360
He's with the other princess because he's worried about her.

00:08:44.360 --> 00:08:46.770
That bastard, whose side is he on?

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:51.230
Wouldn't it just be better if you apologized?

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:52.370
What did you say?

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:52.960
Here we go!

00:09:05.180 --> 00:09:10.150
That was something that my granddaughter Mirano gave to you.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:17.800
I am very happy that my late granddaughter was so important to you,

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:22.380
but you shouldn't force that on Mistress Faris.

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:26.300
She doesn't share those feelings.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.720
I know.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.940
She's here, she's here! Our info was right!

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:34.300
Pete!

00:10:37.850 --> 00:10:39.100
Whoop 'im!

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:53.010
Mira... no...

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.530
Bye-bye~

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:57.750
Pete! Peeeettteee!

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:17.730
C'mon, c'mon! Who's next?!

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:23.860
Hey, get back here!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:29.320
Goblins are shitty opponents after all.

00:11:29.320 --> 00:11:30.870
Princess!

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.910
Princess!!

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:38.410
Princess! Mirano has been...

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:41.120
Mirano has been...

00:11:44.040 --> 00:11:48.530
Lord Pete has gone after Akamashi towards the northern ruins.

00:11:48.530 --> 00:11:50.440
Please hurry, Princess!

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:53.550
Pete, you fuck! What did you stay behind for?!

00:11:53.840 --> 00:11:58.230
If I... If I hadn't come here... Damnit!

00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.680
Hurry, Dominikov!

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:08.730
Where am I?

00:12:09.590 --> 00:12:10.730
Where on earth...

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:12.000
You're awake.

00:12:13.300 --> 00:12:15.760
You were sleeping so well.

00:12:15.760 --> 00:12:17.950
That's what you'd expect from the doctor's sleeping potion.

00:12:18.930 --> 00:12:20.860
Where... is this?

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:25.270
This is the doctor's research laboratory inside the ruins.

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:27.690
It's nice and spacious, isn't it?

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:33.190
Why did you kidnap me?

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:36.460
Isn't it obvious?

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:37.970
We've got something to ask you.

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:40.340
I don't know anything!

00:12:40.340 --> 00:12:41.780
I'm just a handmaid named Mirano...

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.150
Bullshit.

00:12:43.150 --> 00:12:47.190
You aren't the chamberlain's granddaughter, Mirano Entorasia.

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:53.210
We killed Mirano Entorasia the last time we met.

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:55.850
So, who are you?

00:12:56.320 --> 00:13:00.970
Could this have something to do with the princess suddenly becoming so powerful?

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:07.690
And besides...

00:13:07.690 --> 00:13:10.850
That's right; you could be the key.

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:16.220
Are you gonna tell us everything?

00:13:23.830 --> 00:13:24.720
Pete!

00:13:26.770 --> 00:13:28.000
Mistress!

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:29.160
You fuckwit!

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.730
S-Sorry.

00:13:31.280 --> 00:13:33.000
Pete's punishment can wait.

00:13:34.070 --> 00:13:36.450
First we have some guests to take care of.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.160
Mistress, get a move on!

00:14:09.330 --> 00:14:10.550
Take care of them for me!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:42.390
Well?

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:45.410
Feel like talking yet?

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:52.280
It's all right. They don't know anything.

00:14:52.640 --> 00:14:54.330
I mustn't say anything.

00:14:55.230 --> 00:14:57.580
Stubborn, aren't you, Mirano?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:01.910
No. I should say the person calling herself Mirano Entorasia.

00:15:03.550 --> 00:15:05.930
It's fine if you want to be stubborn.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:08.140
But if you carry on...

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:10.960
You'll end up the same way as the old Mirano.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.350
A tad late to be joining the party, don't you think?

00:15:30.650 --> 00:15:33.690
Since it's me, you should have prepared a far better guard!

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.870
I'll be right there, Mirano.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.110
Hold it there!

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:02.980
Do you understand your situation?

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:06.850
Please put down your weapon and stop resisting.

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.350
If you don't...

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:24.160
I get it.

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:25.390
Don't!

00:16:25.860 --> 00:16:28.370
It's you they're really after,

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:31.030
so please, run!

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:33.620
You're talking too much.

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:35.460
Do you want to die?

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:37.350
Hey, you there!

00:16:37.350 --> 00:16:38.380
What?!

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:41.160
If you hurt one hair on Mirano's head...

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.390
This time, I won't stop at just breaking you.

00:16:46.270 --> 00:16:49.100
H-Hurry up and drop your weapons!

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:00.200
Princess!

00:17:00.620 --> 00:17:02.440
That's good...

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:03.380
Get her!

00:17:10.100 --> 00:17:12.450
Princess! Princess!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.890
Princess!

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:27.040
Please, stop it!

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:30.740
In that case, tell us everything we want to know.

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.710
Shit! There's too many of them.

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:48.260
There's no end to this.

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.260
Mistress.

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:00.320
Well? Are you ready to talk?

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:05.360
But that princess is really some princess, huh?

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:08.580
I don't know what kind of secret you have, but...

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:11.820
To risk herself over a mere maid?

00:18:12.390 --> 00:18:13.550
Shut up!

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:23.090
I... I made a promise to someone that I would protect this country without fail!

00:18:23.830 --> 00:18:26.090
Doesn't matter if it's a handmaid or anything else...

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:29.590
I will protect everything in this country!

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:42.100
So you're still capable of insulting us so arrogantly?

00:18:42.900 --> 00:18:47.090
Fine then. Let's see how long you can keep this up.

00:18:47.720 --> 00:18:49.590
Smash her thoroughly!

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:15.640
Trying to escape?!

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:27.440
Mirano.

00:19:29.490 --> 00:19:30.790
Princess Alita...

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:37.160
You came for me...

00:19:39.220 --> 00:19:40.640
I promised, didn't I?

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:45.170
Sorry to break things up,

00:19:46.180 --> 00:19:46.860
but it's coming.

00:19:47.910 --> 00:19:50.370
You're being very contemptuous, aren't you?

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.160
Finish them off!

00:19:57.740 --> 00:19:59.840
In your current state, you'll just be a burden.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:01.470
What?

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.970
Take my horse.

00:20:05.390 --> 00:20:07.220
I will deal with things here.

00:20:07.650 --> 00:20:09.600
You look after Mirano.

00:20:11.550 --> 00:20:12.710
Thanks.

00:20:13.860 --> 00:20:14.730
Let's go.

00:20:17.730 --> 00:20:20.610
You'll be sorry for trying to act so cool!

00:21:03.440 --> 00:21:04.830
Mistress!

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:06.140
So you're safe.

00:21:06.140 --> 00:21:06.650
Yeah.

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:10.510
But more importantly, there's another person I'm worried about.

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:25.270
What is it, Mirano?

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:29.550
B-Brother!

00:21:30.610 --> 00:21:31.440
It can't be!

00:21:38.680 --> 00:21:41.450
It has been a long time, hasn't it, Alita.

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:52.250
Bro...ther...

00:21:58.320 --> 00:22:00.890
Prince Kaito is back!

00:22:00.890 --> 00:22:02.270
Welcome back!

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:04.970
Welcome back, Prince Kaito!
